?","answer":"measured","solution":"The answer stays within the evidence: Mangrove restoration can reduce erosion but is not complete flood protection."},{"title":"Guided example 3","passage":"A school replaced disposable cups with refill stations. Plastic waste fell, but water use rose slightly because the stations required daily cleaning.","prompt":"Which word best describes the passage’s tone?","answer":"measured","solution":"The answer stays within the evidence: The refill program reduced plastic while creating a smaller water-use tradeoff."}]'::jsonb,common_mistakes=array['Selecting a true statement that does not answer the question.','Using personal knowledge instead of passage evidence.','Treating one detail as the main idea of the entire passage.','Choosing extreme language when the author uses qualified language.']::text[],exam_tips=array['Return to the relevant lines instead of relying on memory.','Watch contrast signals such as however, although, and but.','For inference, choose what must or most reasonably follows.','Check axes, units, legends, and time periods in visual information.']::text[],quick_checks='[{"prompt":"Which word best describes the passage’s tone?","answer":"measured","explanation":"The answer stays within the evidence: The better variety depends on the expected water conditions."},{"prompt":"Which word best describes the passage’s tone?","answer":"measured","explanation":"The answer stays within the evidence: Protected lanes increased cycling without substantially delaying buses."},{"prompt":"Which word best describes the passage’s tone?","answer":"measured","explanation":"The answer stays within the evidence: Spaced review improved recall in the described comparison."}]'::jsonb,source_links='[{"title":"DepEd Strengthened Senior High School Program","url":"https://www.deped.gov.ph/strengthened-shs-program/"},{"title":"UPCAT official site","url":"https://upcat.up.edu.ph/"},{"title":"USTET official site","url":"https://ustet.ust.edu.ph/"}]